# Everything is stored with LF in the repository. Without this, a Windows checkout
# commits CRLF back and every cross-platform diff is the whole file.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Shell scripts must keep LF even on a Windows checkout: a CRLF shebang line makes the
# interpreter unfindable, and `install.sh` is run by people who did not clone the repo.
*.sh text eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
